cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the DHiSS anchors, please cite the paper."
title: "HiT (Here is The Text): coordinate anchoring for historical-document OCR"
abstract: >-
  HiT injects word-level coordinate anchors, produced by a document-OCR recognizer
  fine-tuned on the DHiSS dataset, into the prompt of a frozen vision-language model to
  improve transcription of Spanish historical documents.
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous (double-blind submission)"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2025-11-01"
license: MIT
